{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wrinkle Your Brain  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times Trials is an all-ages, arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game that will supercharge your math skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/9a0a698f9017f21e5a2142ad684c21ad.poster.avif?t=1765408980\" width=1100 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/9a0a698f9017f21e5a2142ad684c21ad.webm?t=1765408980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: arrange the falling number blocks to form rows or columns that equal the target number. As the blocks keep falling, you\u2019ll need lightning-quick thinking to make it through. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >41 Ways to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock in Score Mode or plot your victory with Puzzle Mode. Choose from 6 or 7 different math subjects, ranging from addition to algebra. There is sum-thing for everyone!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/52ddb701075d56179896ae646089d457.poster.avif?t=1765408980\" width=1100 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/52ddb701075d56179896ae646089d457.webm?t=1765408980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/52ddb701075d56179896ae646089d457.mp4?t=1765408980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a literal calculator looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >School Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the fun with Versus Mode! Take your skills to the next power by squaring off against friends and family and earn big-brained bragging rights. Who will be the better mathematician?  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/721f26272b7d12509436b02ec9f017d4.poster.avif?t=1765408980\" width=1100 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/721f26272b7d12509436b02ec9f017d4.webm?t=1765408980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/721f26272b7d12509436b02ec9f017d4.mp4?t=1765408980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Steam's Remote Play feature, you can invite friends to battle online without buying multiple copies of the game. The math checks out; that's value!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide cast of lovable characters who will help you add fun to your math practice.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/84b7219fcf829552e40db1326988c204.poster.avif?t=1765408980\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/84b7219fcf829552e40db1326988c204.webm?t=1765408980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by Excellent People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times Trials has had the honor to have industry veterans be a 